OL,3,GNEWSAFire destroys 140 cars at site
OL,4,Aused by Gatwick passengers
OL,5,
OL,6,FHolidaymakers using Gatwick Airport are
OL,7,Ffacing misery at the end of their
OL,8,Ftravels after a fire at a car park used
OL,9,Fby people flying from the hub destroyed
OL,10,F140 vehicles.
OL,12,FThe blaze at Caldyne Business Park near
OL,13,FCrawley broke out shortly after 21:00
OL,14,FBST on Saturday, and images from the
OL,15,Fsite show huge flames and massive
OL,16,Fplumes of smoke above rows of
OL,17,Fstationary cars.
OL,19,FA 67-year-old man was arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of arson, and has been bailed
OL,21,Fpending further inquiries, Sussex
OL,22,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
